      "korean": "두 시에 시작해요.",
      "romanization": "du sie sijakhaeyo.",
      "meaning": "It starts at 2."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "korean": "네, 그때 뵐게요.",
      "romanization": "ne, geuttae boelgeyo.",
      "meaning": "Okay, see you then."
